description	"Renegade Squadron: Spy

^2Weaponry:
- VibroKnife
-- ^4Blue ^7Style Only
- Dual DL-44 Pistols
- 3 Trip Mines
- 3 Sonic Detonators
- 3 Det Packs

^6Inventory:
- Stimpak
- Defense Seeker

^8Attributes:
- Increased stamina pool
- Stamina + Dexterity 3

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS3 Melee]

The Renegade Squadron was a Rebel Alliance military unit of pirates, smugglers, and other types of fringers assembled and commanded by Col Serra at Han Solo's request. The unit consisted of underworlders recruited by Serra from around the galaxy."